# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF（macOS/CI 上的 bash 脚本必须是 LF，否则 bad interpreter）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.plist text eol=lf
*.pbxproj text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.hbc binary
*.ipa binary
